      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈啊～……\r\n从走上这条道路开始，一直到德比结束，\r\n感觉真是眨眼之间啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "daa56b15080182f5a4b56d8f650ffcfa8b88aacc5804acdc79da23263c2aad5f",
