      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "追逐丸善小姐的背影、\r\n实现丸善小姐托付的心愿、以及『想要获胜』。\r\n这些都是驱使我前进的“原点”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf8d1c6d6cbfa54e850a1411eeb6b8d0f192c8fa8d0a918f843d0dfb945f8099",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
